join Juniper left [animation="Fade In" length="1.0" mirrored="true"]
join Lizzy right [animation="Fade In" length="1.0" wait="true"]
Lizzy: hey, Juniper. I am really sorry you didn’t get in. I know it meant a lot to you.
update Juniper [mirrored="false"]
Juniper: it’s okay, honestly. I’d rather be here with you and where I can help the most.
Lizzy: The stuff I was saying earlier, about the prophecy, I’m mostly fine with it. You don’t have to worry about me or anything.
Juniper: I do.
Juniper: And it’s okay.
Juniper: If you’re taking care of everyone, who’s taking care of you?
update Lizzy [mirrored="true"]
Lizzy: ...
update Lizzy [mirrored="false"]
Lizzy: Yeah…
Juniper: I’ll see you tomorrow.
Lizzy: See you tomorrow.
