update Lizzy left [move_time="0.5"]
Lizzy: Juniper!
join Dagger lefter [animation="Slide From Left" mirrored="true"]
update Lizzy right [animation="Bounce" move_time="0.2"]
Dagger: Elizabeth.
update Lizzy [animation="Bounce"]
Lizzy: Jesus Christ, Dagger. What the hell? You can’t just sneak up on me like that. What happened to never seeing each other again?
update Dagger left [move_time="0.5"]
Dagger: I couldn’t stay away.
Dagger: Also I came to warn you.
Dagger: Do not go to your graduation ceremony tomorrow. Stay home and keep your loved ones close.
update Dagger [mirrored="false"]
Dagger: Preferably with your windows boarded up. I will retrieve you when it’s safe to do so.
update Lizzy [animation="Shake X" length="0.3"]
Lizzy: Is that a threat?
update Dagger [mirrored="true"]
Dagger: No, I assure you I have the best of intentions. If something were to you harm you... I’d never forgive myself.
Lizzy: Does this have to do with Lady MacDeath?
update Dagger [mirrored="false"]
Dagger: I have already said too much.
Dagger: Farewell, Lizzy Springs. Heed my warning.
leave Dagger [animation="Slide To Left"]
Dagger: Please.
[wait time="0.4"]
update Lizzy lefter [wait="true" move_time="0.5"]
Lizzy: Dagger! Wait!
update Lizzy left [wait="true" move_time="0.5"]


VO: ugh. I hate when he does that.
VO: He thinks it makes him all mysterious and unattainable. Well, it’s just annoying.

VO: If Dagger felt the need to warn me... I better go the graveyard and ask him for more details.
Lizzy: Time to wolf out.
